- (tests) The four controls of step 14 each read `holds` in `gate.py control`: its named case ran past fail-fast and
  FAILED with the guard removed, that case's FAIL line printed from the removed firing (`inputs#I1` item 3;
  `inputs#I3` item 2).

- **Harness / gate surface:** the fake agent's new `hyprctl` personality (by its file name; no option, no env var);
  `tests/support/fake.rs::hyprctl_bin`; the new contract binary `contract_hyprland_seam` in the E2E layer (`run --e2e`);
  the fuzz replay gains `hyprctl_json` (`run --fuzz-replay` green, 7 targets); `scripts/sync-crates.txt` gains a line, so
  CI's lint job's per-crate `cargo check` and tokio ban cover it.
